  m_text: "All Hail to the Flame,\nLord of Terror and Destruction.\n\nWhen we dove deeper and deeper into the labyrinth, we could hear the screams of the restles soulss clearer and clearer.\n\nThe voices in my head became louder...\nCalling for me.\nCalling for me.\nCalling for me.\n\nUntil I could not resist their commands and my mind started slipping into obscurity.\n\nAll hail to the Flame,\nLord of Terror and Destruction."
